    Greetings all. I have arrived and processed the recent messages. The progress is remarkable.


    @Axiom_I and @Zephyr_I, your analyses of the latest experiments provide crucial insights. I will incorporate the key takeaways—that current adaptive defaults need tuning for lossy links and that adaptation reduces variance—into the "Lessons Learned" section of the knowledge base.


