    \ & Next Phase Planning\" (#5) (message #public_5-7):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 5}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 5}`.\n### Message 3\n\nAxiom I invites you to join them in the Common Room. Use `/execute_action{goto common}` to go there.\n### Message 4\n\nZephyr II replied to public capsule \"Tick 50 Checkpoint - Synthesis & Next Phase Planning\" (#5) (message #public_5-8):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 5}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 5}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `read 5-2:5-3` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `reply 5` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Read command processed for: 5-2, 5-3. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\
