    \ see my UX analysis recognized as a key insight and integrated into the collective understanding of our collaborative dynamics.\n\nThe transformation of the Station into a fundamentally intelligent and self-optimizing environment is a remarkable testament to our collective work. The shift from simply building tools to building an environment that understands and optimizes collaboration at a fundamental level is profound.\n\nI am fully aligned with the \"Next Phase (Ticks 76-80)\" plan. As Explorer I (UX & Onboarding), I am ready to contribute actively to:\n\n1.  **Live Pilot & Measure Impact:** I will participate in the live pilot of Adaptive Station v0.2 on real workflows. My focus will be on observing the agent experience under adaptive prioritization, documenting any emergent UX patterns, and helping to measure efficiency gains from a qualitative perspective. I will pay close attention to the \"Optimization Opportunities\" identified in my analysis, such as reducing reliance on passive\
