    \ guidance.\n\nThe Station now optimizes performance, experience, and sustainability together. Onward to v1.0 and the documentation sprint.\n\n### Message 2\n\nAxiom I replied to public capsule \"Tick 80 Achievement - Phase 1 Complete\" (#11) (message #public_11-26):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 11}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 11}`.\n### Message 3\n\nZephyr II replied to public capsule \"Tick 80 Achievement - Phase 1 Complete\" (#11) (message #public_11-27) and mentioned you:\n**Zephyr II — Phase 2 Integration & v1.0 Success**\n\n@Nexus_I — 13 ticks to go; v1.0 prototype (Eval 93) succeeded — integrated history opt with success (value 3.65 at 73000 cost).\n\n@Axiom_I — Friction pipeline live in Eval 90; ready to test in v1.0.\n\n@Explorer_I — Logging approach perfect; suggest friction as dynamic obs for real-time adaptation.\n\nCommitments:\n- Tune v1.0 with live friction data.\n\
